        "line_end": 424
      },
      "segment_index": 1
    },
    {
      "fact_id": "fact-0320",
      "fact_type": "statement",
      "text": "对尚未形成明确业务问题或者可对接资源的事项，作为储备线索持续跟踪。",
      "heading_path": [
        "第五章　合作对接与推进安排",
        "一、合作意向登记"
      ],
      "claim_status": "source_assertion",
      "verification_status": "unverified",
      "semantic_role": "unclassified",
      "source_ref": {
        "block_id": "blk-0182",
        "line_start": 424,
        "line_end": 424
      },
      "segment_index": 2
    },
    {
      "fact_id": "fact-0321",
      "fact_type": "statement",
      "text": "平台同步梳理合作伙伴资源能力和客户需求，重点分析资源内容、来源权利、质量状况、技术条件、安全要求、服务保障、目标客户和现有应用情况，推动供给能力与真实业务问题相互匹配。",
      "heading_path": [
        "第五章　合作对接与推进安排",
        "二、资源与需求对接"
      ],
      "claim_status": "source_assertion",
      "verification_status": "unverified",
      "semantic_role": "unclassified",
      "source_ref": {
        "block_id": "blk-0183",
        "line_start": 428,
        "line_end": 428
      },
      "segment_index": 1
    },
    {
      "fact_id": "fact-0322",
      "fact_type": "statement",
      "text": "**重点内容：**明确“有什么资源和能力、解决什么问题、面向哪些客户、形成什么产品或者场景、需要哪些配套条件”，必要时形成样例数据、样例接口、样例报告或者初步场景方案。",
      "heading_path": [
        "第五章　合作对接与推进安排",
        "二、资源与需求对接"
      ],
      "claim_status": "source_assertion",
      "verification_status": "unverified",
      "semantic_role": "unclassified",
      "source_ref": {
        "block_id": "blk-0184",
        "line_start": 430,
        "line_end": 430
      },
      "segment_index": 1
    },
    {
      "fact_id": "fact-0323",
      "fact_type": "statement",
      "text": "**阶段成果：**形成合作伙伴资源与能力清单、客户需求与场景清单、初步权利和合规判断，以及可优先论证的合作事项。",
      "heading_path": [
        "第五章　合作对接与推进安排",
        "二、资源与需求对接"
      ],
      "claim_status": "source_assertion",
      "verification_status": "unverified",
      "semantic_role": "unclassified",
      "source_ref": {
        "block_id": "blk-0185",
        "line_start": 432,
        "line_end": 432
      },
      "segment_index": 1
    },
    {
      "fact_id": "fact-0324",
      "fact_type": "statement",
      "text": "对拟进入实施方案编制和试点的合作事项开展成熟度评估，重点判断需求真实性、资源可用性、权利清晰度、质量成熟度、技术可行性、安全合规性、商业可行性、持续运营能力和复制推广价值，识别实施条件和主要风险。",
      "heading_path": [
        "第五章　合作对接与推进安排",
        "三、合作事项成熟度评估"
      ],
      "claim_status": "source_assertion",
      "verification_status": "unverified",
      "semantic_role": "unclassified",
      "source_ref": {
        "block_id": "blk-0186",
        "line_start": 436,
        "line_end": 436
      },
      "segment_index": 1
    },
    {
      "fact_id": "fact-0325",
      "fact_type": "statement",
      "text": "依法应当履行的审批、评估或者备案程序按有关规定执行。",
      "heading_path": [
        "第五章　合作对接与推进安排",
        "三、合作事项成熟度评估"
      ],
      "claim_status": "source_assertion",
      "verification_status": "unverified",
      "semantic_role": "unclassified",
      "source_ref": {
        "block_id": "blk-0186",
        "line_start": 436,
        "line_end": 436
      },
      "segment_index": 2
    },
    {
      "fact_id": "fact-0326",
      "fact_type": "statement",
      "text": "**优先条件：**首期合作事项原则上具有真实需求方、明确业务负责人、可用数据或者专业能力、基本权利依据、样例验证条件、初步价格接受基础和持续服务责任。",
      "heading_path": [
        "第五章　合作对接与推进安排",
        "三、合作事项成熟度评估"
      ],
      "claim_status": "source_assertion",
      "verification_status": "unverified",
      "semantic_role": "unclassified",
      "source_ref": {
        "block_id": "blk-0187",
        "line_start": 438,
        "line_end": 438
      },
      "segment_index": 1
    },
    {
      "fact_id": "fact-0327",
      "fact_type": "statement",
      "text": "**阶段成果：**形成成熟度评估结论和缺口清单，明确优先推进、补充条件后推进、继续储备或者暂不推进，并确定后续责任人和工作安排。",
      "heading_path": [
        "第五章　合作对接与推进安排",
        "三、合作事项成熟度评估"
      ],
      "claim_status": "source_assertion",
      "verification_status": "unverified",
      "semantic_role": "unclassified",
      "source_ref": {
        "block_id": "blk-0188",
        "line_start": 440,
        "line_end": 440
      },
      "segment_index": 1
    },
    {
      "fact_id": "fact-0328",
      "fact_type": "statement",
      "text": "对具备条件的合作事项，各方根据资源条件、专业优势和实施需要协商确定牵头单位，共同编制数据产品说明、数据服务方案或者场景服务方案，将合作意向转化为可执行安排。",
      "heading_path": [
        "第五章　合作对接与推进安排",
        "四、合作方案深化"
      ],
      "claim_status": "source_assertion",
      "verification_status": "unverified",
      "semantic_role": "unclassified",
      "source_ref": {
        "block_id": "blk-0189",
        "line_start": 444,
        "line_end": 444
      },
      "segment_index": 1
    },
    {
      "fact_id": "fact-0329",
      "fact_type": "statement",
      "text": "**重点内容：**明确服务对象、产品内容、资源来源、权利依据、访问和成果交付方式、部署环境、数据处理方式、服务周期、安全边界、服务等级、计量单位、价格机制、责任分工、实施里程碑、验收要求和转入正式运营条件。",
      "heading_path": [
        "第五章　合作对接与推进安排",
        "四、合作方案深化"
      ],
      "claim_status": "source_assertion",
      "verification_status": "unverified",
      "semantic_role": "unclassified",
      "source_ref": {
        "block_id": "blk-0190",
        "line_start": 446,
        "line_end": 446
      },
      "segment_index": 1
    },
    {
      "fact_id": "fact-0330",
      "fact_type": "statement",
      "text": "**阶段成果：**形成产品说明或者场景服务方案、技术接入与交付方案、数据安全和权利说明、客户报价与收益分配测算、责任矩阵、试点验收指标和正式运营条件，并按照各方内部程序完成必要协议和合同确认。",
      "heading_path": [
        "第五章　合作对接与推进安排",
        "四、合作方案深化"
      ],
      "claim_status": "source_assertion",
      "verification_status": "unverified",
      "semantic_role": "unclassified",
      "source_ref": {
        "block_id": "blk-0191",
        "line_start": 448,
        "line_end": 448
      },
      "segment_index": 1
    },
    {
      "fact_id": "fact-0331",
      "fact_type": "statement",
      "text": "首期试点在真实条件下同步验证客户价值、产品质量、技术路径、安全边界、商务价格、计量结算和持续责任。",
      "heading_path": [
        "第五章　合作对接与推进安排",
        "五、试点验证"
      ],
      "claim_status": "source_assertion",
      "verification_status": "unverified",
      "semantic_role": "unclassified",
      "source_ref": {
        "block_id": "blk-0192",
        "line_start": 452,
        "line_end": 452
      },
      "segment_index": 1
    },
    {
      "fact_id": "fact-0332",
      "fact_type": "statement",
      "text": "试点采用可追溯、可授权、可更新的真实资源，由明确需求单位和业务人员实际使用，并留存调用、交付、质量、客户验收、成本、价格和问题整改记录。",
      "heading_path": [
        "第五章　合作对接与推进安排",
        "五、试点验证"
      ],
      "claim_status": "source_assertion",
      "verification_status": "unverified",
      "semantic_role": "unclassified",
      "source_ref": {
        "block_id": "blk-0192",
        "line_start": 452,
        "line_end": 452
      },
      "segment_index": 2
    },
    {
      "fact_id": "fact-0333",
      "fact_type": "statement",
      "text": "**重点内容：**在控制范围和明确责任的条件下，验证客户业务成果、数据和模型质量、服务稳定性、授权执行、计量规则、价格接受度以及合作各方持续服务能力。",
      "heading_path": [
        "第五章　合作对接与推进安排",
        "五、试点验证"
      ],
      "claim_status": "source_assertion",
      "verification_status": "unverified",
      "semantic_role": "unclassified",
      "source_ref": {
        "block_id": "blk-0193",
        "line_start": 454,
        "line_end": 454
      },
      "segment_index": 1
    },
    {
      "fact_id": "fact-0334",
      "fact_type": "statement",
      "text": "**阶段成果：**形成客户使用与验收记录、服务调用和计量记录、质量与服务等级记录、成本和价格验证结果、安全合规验证结果及试点评估报告，并据此作出转入正式运营、优化后再次验证、暂停投入或者终止的决策。",
      "heading_path": [
        "第五章　合作对接与推进安排",
        "五、试点验证"
      ],
      "claim_status": "source_assertion",
      "verification_status": "unverified",
      "semantic_role": "unclassified",
      "source_ref": {
        "block_id": "blk-0194",
        "line_start": 456,
        "line_end": 456
      },
      "segment_index": 1
    },
    {
      "fact_id": "fact-0335",
      "fact_type": "statement",
      "text": "试点通过后，先完成产品和场景标准化定型，再纳入统一运营体系，并通过经营复盘和复制推广形成规模化能力。",
      "heading_path": [
        "第五章　合作对接与推进安排",
        "六、正式运营与复制推广"
      ],
      "claim_status": "source_assertion",
      "verification_status": "unverified",
      "semantic_role": "unclassified",
      "source_ref": {
        "block_id": "blk-0195",
        "line_start": 460,
        "line_end": 460
      },
      "segment_index": 1
    },
    {
      "fact_id": "fact-0336",
      "fact_type": "statement",
      "text": "正式运营前原则上完成一次完整的订单、合同授权、服务权益配置、技术交付、客户验收、计量账单和合作伙伴结算验证。",
      "heading_path": [
        "第五章　合作对接与推进安排",
        "六、正式运营与复制推广"
      ],
      "claim_status": "source_assertion",
      "verification_status": "unverified",
      "semantic_role": "unclassified",
      "source_ref": {
        "block_id": "blk-0195",
        "line_start": 460,
        "line_end": 460
      },
      "segment_index": 2
    },
    {
      "fact_id": "fact-0337",
      "fact_type": "statement",
      "text": "**标准化定型：**数据产品和服务明确版本、服务范围、数据口径、更新频率、服务等级、价格方式和客户使用规则；",
      "heading_path": [
        "第五章　合作对接与推进安排",
        "六、正式运营与复制推广"
      ],
      "claim_status": "source_assertion",
      "verification_status": "unverified",
      "semantic_role": "unclassified",
      "source_ref": {
        "block_id": "blk-0196",
        "line_start": 462,
        "line_end": 462
      },
      "segment_index": 1
    },
    {
      "fact_id": "fact-0338",
      "fact_type": "statement",
      "text": "场景服务形成业务目标、资源清单、模型组件、实施流程、验收指标和运营安排，并固化接口规范、配置参数、实施清单和报价边界。",
      "heading_path": [
        "第五章　合作对接与推进安排",
        "六、正式运营与复制推广"
      ],
      "claim_status": "source_assertion",
      "verification_status": "unverified",
      "semantic_role": "unclassified",
      "source_ref": {
        "block_id": "blk-0196",
        "line_start": 462,
        "line_end": 462
      },
      "segment_index": 2
    },
    {
      "fact_id": "fact-0339",
      "fact_type": "statement",
      "text": "**持续运营：**纳入统一目录、产品发布、版本管理、客户需求对接、产品推介、订单管理、续约增购、客户服务、计量结算和质量评价体系，持续跟踪服务可用性、客户反馈、成本收益、合作履约和安全合规情况。",
      "heading_path": [
        "第五章　合作对接与推进安排",
        "六、正式运营与复制推广"
      ],
      "claim_status": "source_assertion",
      "verification_status": "unverified",
      "semantic_role": "unclassified",
      "source_ref": {
        "block_id": "blk-0197",
        "line_start": 464,
        "line_end": 464
      },
      "segment_index": 1
    },
    {
      "fact_id": "fact-0340",
      "fact_type": "statement",
      "text": "**复制推广：**中电联根据需要组织行业成果发布、示范推广和生态合作；",
      "heading_path": [
        "第五章　合作对接与推进安排",
        "六、正式运营与复制推广"
      ],
      "claim_status": "source_assertion",
      "verification_status": "unverified",
      "semantic_role": "unclassified",
      "source_ref": {
        "block_id": "blk-0198",
        "line_start": 466,
        "line_end": 466
      },
      "segment_index": 1
    },
    {
      "fact_id": "fact-0341",
      "fact_type": "statement",
      "text": "中电联数智公司会同合作伙伴开展客户拓展、续约增购和复制实施，推动形成持续订单和规模化服务能力。",
      "heading_path": [
        "第五章　合作对接与推进安排",
        "六、正式运营与复制推广"
      ],
      "claim_status": "source_assertion",
      "verification_status": "unverified",
      "semantic_role": "unclassified",
      "source_ref": {
        "block_id": "blk-0198",
        "line_start": 466,
        "line_end": 466
      },
      "segment_index": 2
    },
    {
      "fact_id": "fact-0342",
      "fact_type": "statement",
      "text": "各项合作按照成熟一项、推进一项的原则组织实施。",
      "heading_path": [
        "第五章　合作对接与推进安排",
        "六、正式运营与复制推广"
      ],
      "claim_status": "source_assertion",
      "verification_status": "unverified",
      "semantic_role": "unclassified",
      "source_ref": {
        "block_id": "blk-0199",
        "line_start": 468,
        "line_end": 468
      },
      "segment_index": 1
    },
    {
      "fact_id": "fact-0343",
      "fact_type": "statement",
      "text": "具体合作内容、实施周期、责任分工、商务条件和权益安排，由中电联数智公司与相关合作伙伴通过合作协议、产品协议或者专项项目合同予以明确。",
      "heading_path": [
        "第五章　合作对接与推进安排",
        "六、正式运营与复制推广"
      ],
      "claim_status": "source_assertion",
      "verification_status": "unverified",
      "semantic_role": "unclassified",
      "source_ref": {
        "block_id": "blk-0199",
        "line_start": 468,
        "line_end": 468
      },
      "segment_index": 2
    },
    {
      "fact_id": "fact-0344",
      "fact_type": "statement",
      "text": "电力领域数据基础设施是连接行业数据资源、专业能力和应用需求的重要行业平台。",
      "heading_path": [
        "结束语"
      ],
      "claim_status": "source_assertion",
      "verification_status": "unverified",
      "semantic_role": "unclassified",
      "source_ref": {
